  <entity00139214:DescriptionOfForeignExchangeRateChangesAndOtherItemsRelatedToAmortizedCostMeasuredDebtSecurities contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">유효이자율 상각액 및 신용손실충당금 Unwinding effect가 포함되어 있습니다.</entity00139214:DescriptionOfForeignExchangeRateChangesAndOtherItemsRelatedToAmortizedCostMeasuredDebtSecurities>
  <entity00139214:ExplanationOfTheCreditLossAllowanceRatio contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">상각후원가측정대출채권 총장부금액에서 이연대출부대손익 및 현재가치할인차금 차감하기 전 금액 대비 신용손실충당금 비율입니다.</entity00139214:ExplanationOfTheCreditLossAllowanceRatio>
  <entity00139214:DescriptionOfInsuranceContractLoansOfDisclosureOfLoanAtAmortisedCostByTypeOfLoanLineItemsOfDisclosureOfLoanAtAmortisedCostByTypeOfLoanTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_dart_LoansUnderInsuranceTermsMember" xml:lang="ko">투자계약부채와 관련된 보험계약대출입니다.</entity00139214:DescriptionOfInsuranceContractLoansOfDisclosureOfLoanAtAmortisedCostByTypeOfLoanLineItemsOfDisclosureOfLoanAtAmortisedCostByTypeOfLoanTableOfItems>
