  <entity00139214:DescriptionOfDividendIncomeAndGainsLossesOnDisposal contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">관계종속기업투자주식 처분손익 및 배당금수익은 제외하였습니다.</entity00139214:DescriptionOfDividendIncomeAndGainsLossesOnDisposal>
